--- !u!114 &1834718789
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1834718782}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 111446228d2b6cf4c99f6bc33b6a9b69, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialougeBox
  textComp: {fileID: 566830995}
  lines:
  - 'Coconut Ronald(Land Owner): John! John Victorio, is that you? Thank God! You
    need to get here! Right now! I''m at the north end of the island, near the old
    lighthouse. They''re here, the loggers...'
  - 'There must be a dozen of them! I tried to stop them, but they just laughed!
    John, I can hear the axes! The awful thud-thud-thud of steel biting deep into
    the ancient ironwoods! '
  - "They're working in shifts\u2014it's systematic! They've already taken down the
    two biggest ones near the cove! "
  - 'Please, you need to call the Coast Guard, or... or just get here yourself! They''re
    destroying everything! The air is full of splintered wood! It''s happening too
    fast!" '
  - 'Coconut Ronald(Land Owner): John! You came! Thank God! Look! Look what they''ve
    done! '
  - 'John (Player): I see it, Coconut. I got your call. How many men? And where are
    they concentrated now? '
  - "Coconut Ronald(Land Owner): At least a dozen! Maybe more! They were at the cove,
    now they're working the main slope. John, they\u2019re relentless!"
  - 'They''re cutting down every single tree they see! If we don''t stop them right
    now, this island will become nothing but barren dirt and stumps! '
  - "At least a dozen! Maybe more! They were at the cove, now they're working the
    main slope. John, they\u2019re relentless!"
  - 'John (Player): Unbelievable. This isn''t just a few rogue loggers. This is an
    organized operation. '
  - Stay here. I need to get a closer look. And try to keep out of sight.
  - 'John (Player): Stop! This is protected land! I am a Nature Enforcement Officer!
    Drop your tools and leave immediately! '
  - 'Did you hear me?! You are under arrest for illegal deforestation! '
  - '(John draws the non-lethal Galf Launcher.) '
  txtsSpeed: 0.1
  index: 0
  timeline: {fileID: 478226560}
  stopPoints: 030000000a0000000d000000
